{"ORD_ASK_ORDERS","reg=law,swat",{"Hold the line, protect civilians, report anything unusual","Keep the peace till somebody tells us different, that's all","Radio's been dead, nobody above us left to ask, so we wing it","Stay at our post until we're relieved, whenever that is","Hold the line, protect who we can, no new orders came after the first night","Stay on station until relieved, nobody's relieved us yet","Keep the civilians calm, nobody told us how"}},
{"ORD_ASK_ORDERS","reg=military,elite",{"Hold position and await relief, that's all I've got","Maintain the perimeter, contain the infected, that's the mission","Orders are classified, but between us, they stopped coming days ago","We protect the line, civilians pass or turn back, simple","Hold position, assist civilians, wait for relief, relief hasn't come","Secure the area - don't ask me what comes next, I don't know","Orders are to hold, so we hold"}},
{"ORD_ASK_ORDERS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Why are you asking me? I'm not in the military, I'm a plumber"}},
{"ORD_ASK_SHELTER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Taking people in? Maybe, we've got limited space, depends who you are","I heard of a place, but I don't know if it's real, I wouldn't bet my life on it","We took in a couple of folks last week, but we're full now, I'm sorry","Shelter? Ask around, someone might have a spare room, a barn, anything","There's a rumor of a safe spot, but rumors die as fast as people","We can't take anyone, but I can point you in a direction, for what it's worth","We heard a church was taking people in, might be a rumor","Not that I know of, everyone's staying put or dead"}},
{"ORD_ASK_SHELTER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"Please, if you find a place, tell me, tell me, I'm desperate too"}},
{"ORD_ASK_SHELTER","reg=family",{"Our door's open to anyone in need, child, anyone"}},
{"ORD_ASK_SHELTER","reg=law,swat",{"Few cots down at the station, get there early or sleep on the floor"}},
{"ORD_ASK_SHELTER","reg=military,elite",{"Civilian shelters are in progress, check back tomorrow"}},
{"ORD_ASK_SHELTER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|world=water",{"There's talk of a place past the river, nobody's come back to confirm"}},
{"ORD_ASK_SHELTER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|world=fence",{"Try the high school, last I heard, it had a fence"}},
{"ORD_ASK_TOLL","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Toll? Heh, everything you've got, plus a smile","Toll's a bottle, a pack of smokes, or your left hand, your choice","You want to pass? Pay up, three items, or fight","It costs whatever's in your pockets, kid, and we're not picky","Toll? Ha, you'll pay it, one way or another","The price? Your boots, your bullets, and your attitude"}},
{"ORD_ASK_TOLL","reg=outlaw,club,crime",{"Everyone pays something, food, ammo, medicine - don't make me guess","A fair price, whatever you can spare, and nobody gets hurt","You pay, you walk, simple as that"}},
{"ORD_ASK_TOLL","reg=raider,gang,prison",{"Everything you've got, that's the toll","Pay up or bleed - your pick","The usual: your stuff, and we don't hurt you"}},
{"ORD_AT_EASE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"Oh, thank you, thank you, I'm going, I won't forget this","Oh thank God, thank you, thank you, I'm going, I'm going","Thank you- lowering 'em, see, no sudden moves","Going- I'm going, thank you, Jesus, thank you"}},
{"ORD_AT_EASE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned",{"Finally, took you long enough, my arms were killing me","Finally, my arms were killing me","Thanks, now beat it before I change my mind","Thanks, I guess, now beat it"}},
{"ORD_AT_EASE","reg=law,swat",{"Stay out of trouble","We're done here, don't let me see you again","Appreciated, we'll go our way","All right, easing off"}},
{"ORD_AT_EASE","reg=military,elite",{"Move along","At ease, clear out","Standing down, copy","Appreciated - don't make me regret it"}},
{"ORD_AT_EASE","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Heh, you're a tease","Heh, now that's more like it, scram","Heh, you're no fun, but alright"}},
{"ORD_AT_EASE","reg=family",{"Lord, I thought we were done for, thank you kindly"}},
{"ORD_AT_EASE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Thank you - thank you - we'll go","Oh God, okay, I'm going, I'm going","Thank you... I won't forget you didn't hurt us"}},
{"ORD_AT_EASE","reg=outlaw,club,crime",{"Smart choice, we'll be on our way","Alright, be seeing you"}},
{"ORD_AT_EASE","reg=raider,gang,prison",{"Yeah, sure, we'll be seeing you","About time - let's go"}},
{"ORD_DROP_OK","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"Putting it down- slow, see? I'm so scared I can't feel my hands","It's down, it's down, I dropped it, please don't, please...","Take it, take it, I never wanted the thing, my dad made me carry it","Okay, dropping it, it's on the ground, see? don't shoot me","Down! It's down! Oh God, I almost dropped it on my foot, sorry, sorry","It's down, it's down, it's on the ground, I don't want it, I never wanted it!","Here, here, take it, it was my father's, I don't even know how to use it","Please, don't hurt me, I dropped it, I DROPPED it, see?","Oh God, oh God, I'm shaking so hard I nearly shot myself, there, it's down"}},
{"ORD_DROP_OK","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned",{"It's down, don't shoot","There, it's on the floor, are you happy? now back off","Dropping it, but don't think this is over","Weapon's down, fine, go on, say what you want to say","It's down, it's down, relax, jeez","There, down, now we're both unarmed, happy?","Fine, dropping it, stop waving that thing around","It's down, you can relax now, jeez","It's down, but I'm grabbing it again if you try anything"}},
{"ORD_DROP_OK","reg=law,swat",{"Weapon down, slowly","Weapon down, but I've got your face memorized","Dropped it, now let's talk, calmly","Weapon down, but I want you to remember this moment","Weapon's down, now you're going to tell me why","Putting it on the ground - slow - see that?","Alright, it's down - let's talk","Dropping my weapon - don't make this worse"}},
{"ORD_DROP_OK","reg=military,elite",{"Down, as ordered","Weapon on the ground, stay calm","Dropped, hands visible","Weapon on the ground, hands visible, let's keep it civil","Weapon down, I'm trusting you with that","It's on the ground - don't make me regret it","Dropped, your move, and make it a good one","Sidearm's down - keep your finger off the trigger"}},
{"ORD_DROP_OK","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Fine, it's down","Heh, fine, down it goes, you've got guts, kid","Dropped, dropped, don't get excited, geez","There, happy now? Don't think this ends here","Dropped it, there, now what? You gonna shoot me with a dropped gun?","Heh, down it goes, no hard feelings, kid"}},
{"ORD_DROP_OK","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful,neutral",{"Down, there, don't come closer, I mean it"}},
{"ORD_DROP_OK","reg=family",{"Honey, there you go, no need to get excited","Put it down, children, put it down, {he}'s not going to hurt us"}},
{"ORD_DROP_OK","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|tmp=predator",{"Drop it? Ha, fine, I've got another one","Down, huh? I've got two more, but sure"}},
{"ORD_DROP_OK","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=veteran",{"Dropped","Down"}},
{"ORD_DROP_OK","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Here, I'm dropping it - please, it's down","I never wanted to use it anyway, it's on the ground","Look, it's down, it's on the ground- don't hurt us!","Dropping it, I'm dropping it"}},
{"ORD_DROP_OK","reg=outlaw,club,crime",{"Fine, there, it's on the floor","You want it? It's down - take a good look","There, it's on the ground, happy?","There - satisfied?"}},
{"ORD_DROP_OK","reg=raider,gang,prison",{"Yeah, it's down - don't get used to this","Fine, take it - take a damn good look at it","There, on the ground - now what, hero?","Down - happy? You don't scare me"}},
{"ORD_FOLLOW_OK","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Right behind you, don't go too fast","Go ahead, I'm right behind you","I'll come with you, just don't leave me behind","Alright, I'm right behind you - please be careful","Anywhere's better than here - go on, I'm following"}},
{"ORD_FOLLOW_OK","reg=law,swat",{"Following","Following, but I'm armed, remember that","Leading, I'm behind you","Behind you, but I'm keeping my hand on my weapon","Fine, I'll tag along - eyes open","Lead on, I'll watch our backs","Alright, let's move - stay in sight","I'll follow - don't make me regret it"}},
{"ORD_FOLLOW_OK","reg=military,elite",{"Behind you","Falling in, lead on","Copy, behind you","Following - keep your pace down, I'll cover our rear","Understood, lead the way","I'm behind you - move out","Alright, moving - keep it tight"}},
{"ORD_FOLLOW_OK","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Lead on","I'll follow, but you try anything and I'll gut you","Yeah, yeah, I'm coming, quit sweating","Lead on, kid, I'm with you for now","Okay, I'm walking, but I'll stab you if you lead us into a hole","Heh, I'll follow, kid, I'm curious where this goes"}},
{"ORD_FOLLOW_OK","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"I'll come, I'll come- just don't leave me out here, please","Right on your heels, not a peep out of me","Yes, yes, I'm coming, lead the way, I'll do whatever you say","Okay!! Okay, I'll follow, I'll be right behind you, don't go too fast!","Lead the way, lead the way, I'll do exactly what you say","Right behind you, right behind, step for step"}},
{"ORD_FOLLOW_OK","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned",{"I'm on your tail, quit looking back at me and walk","Fine, lead on, but I'm watching everything","Following, following, hurry up, would you?","I'm behind you, but if this is a trap, I'll haunt you","Lead on, I'm on your heels","Fine, walking, watch the pace"}},
{"ORD_FOLLOW_OK","reg=family",{"Alright, dear, I'm coming, take it slow, my hips aren't what they used to be","Slowly, dear, I'm not as quick as I used to be"}},
{"ORD_FOLLOW_OK","reg=outlaw,club,crime",{"Sure, why not - lead on","I'll walk along for a bit - don't push your luck","Alright, let's see where you're taking us","Fine, but I'm keeping my eyes on you"}},
{"ORD_FOLLOW_OK","reg=raider,gang,prison",{"Yeah, alright, walk, I'm right behind you","I'm following you, and you won't like it if this is a trap","Fine, move it","Lead the way, then, I'll be watching"}},
{"ORD_FRISK_EMPTY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Nothing, there's nothing left, I already gave it all away","You've got everything, there's nothing else, honest","Search me, search me, I've got nothing","I've got nothing else - nothing - look","That's it, I swear, that's everything","There's nothing left - please believe me"}},
