{"ORD_FRISK_EMPTY","reg=military,elite",{"Nothing further, I'm clean","Nothing more, I was traveling light","That's the lot - done?"}},
{"ORD_FRISK_EMPTY","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Heh, nothing, I'm broke, sorry to disappoint","Empty, {g:pal|lady}, you're out of luck"}},
{"ORD_FRISK_EMPTY","reg=outlaw,club,crime",{"Nothing left, you got the lot","Pockets are empty - see?"}},
