{"ORD_FRISK_FAR","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Come over here and search me, I'm not moving, I've got nothing to hide","Come closer if you want to search, I'm not going to throw it to you","You want to check me? Come check me, I'm not moving","I'm not moving, if you want it, come here - slow","Come closer, I'm not putting my hands down"}},
{"ORD_FRISK_FAR","reg=law,swat",{"You want a search, come and do it","You want a search, you walk over here","You want a search? Come here, nice and slow","Not from over there - come closer"}},
