{"ORD_FRISK_ITEMS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"Please, not that, please, it's all I have left, please...","Take it, take it all- but not the picture, please, it's just a picture!","That's everything, there's nothing else, that's it","Take it, but leave the photo, please, it's my son"}},
{"ORD_FRISK_ITEMS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned",{"There, empty pockets, take everything, you low-life","Fine, take it all, I hope it chokes you","Go ahead, take it, I've lost more than this","There, empty pockets, take it all, I hope it chokes you","Fine, fine, take what you want, I've lost more than this"}},
{"ORD_FRISK_ITEMS","reg=family",{"Oh, honey, not my medicine, please, leave me my medicine"}},
{"ORD_FRISK_ITEMS","reg=law,swat",{"Take it, I'll remember your face","Take what you need, leave the medical stuff, people are counting on it","Pockets are empty - satisfied?","That's everything - don't push it"}},
{"ORD_FRISK_ITEMS","reg=military,elite",{"Items surrendered, you will be reported","Items surrendered under protest","Everything - check twice, you won't find more","Take it - rations too - don't make me watch you eat it","That's what I carry - nothing hidden"}},
{"ORD_FRISK_ITEMS","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Ha, you're robbing me? That's rich, fine, take it","Take the stupid stuff, I've got worse in the other pocket","Ha, take it, kid, but I'm coming for it later"}},
{"ORD_FRISK_ITEMS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"That's it, that's everything we've got, honest to God","Take it, just leave us enough to last the night","Please, that's our food. ...Fine, take it"}},
