{"ORD_FRISK_ITEMS","reg=raider,gang,prison",{"Take it, then! Take the damn lot!","That's it, that's all of it - happy?","You're robbing me? Seriously? Fine!"}},
{"ORD_FRISK_WEAPONS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"Here, here, take them, please, I don't want them anyway","Take them, take them, I just want to go home","That's all of it, that's it, that's everything","Take them, take them all, I never wanted them anyway","This is all I have, it's all of it"}},
{"ORD_FRISK_WEAPONS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned",{"There, take them, you've got your toys now","Take them all, I'll find another one","Here, that's all I've got, you happy?","There, take it, that's everything, you vulture","Fine, take 'em, I know where to find more"}},
