{"ORD_FRISK_WEAPONS","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Heh, take them, I've got more where those came from","Fine, fine, take 'em, you'll regret it","Heh, take 'em, I've got more at home","You win, take them"}},
{"ORD_FRISK_WEAPONS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Take it, take it all, just don't hurt me","That's all I have - please, just go","Here, it's the only thing keeping us alive - take it"}},
