{"ORD_GROUP_HANDS_UP","reg=civilian,family",{"Mine are up too, don't shoot!","Please, we don't want trouble","Do what {he} says, everyone - hands up","Don't shoot, please don't shoot us","Everybody stay calm - nobody move"}},
{"ORD_GROUP_HANDS_UP","reg=worker",{"Hands up, fellas - do it","Not worth dying over - hands up","Easy now, nobody's reaching for nothing","Do as they say, just do it"}},
