{"ORD_GROUP_HANDS_UP","reg=law,swat",{"Everyone slow - hands up, nobody does anything stupid","Hold your fire - they're up","Hands where {he} can see them, easy","Do not reach for anything - hands up","Up, everyone, nice and slow","Hands up, everyone, don't make this worse","Hands up, folks, nice and slow"}},
{"ORD_GROUP_HANDS_UP","reg=military,elite",{"Hands up, nobody reaches for anything","Stand down, everybody, hands up","Not here, not like this - hands up","Do it - slowly - hands up","Up, comply, follow orders","Hands up, stay calm, follow orders","Hands up, comply, follow orders"}},
{"ORD_GROUP_HANDS_UP","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Dammit - fine - hands up, boys","Not worth it - hands up","You got us - hands are up","Easy, easy, nobody's reaching for nothing","Hands up, boys, we've been outplayed","Hands up, boys, we've got company","Fuck, hands up, hands up, don't be heroes","Everyone, hands up, we've been made"}},
{"ORD_GROUP_HANDS_UP","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"Everybody up with 'em!! Do what {he} says, PLEASE!","Don't shoot us, please, please, we're not armed!","They got GUNS!! Up, get 'em up, everybody, UP!","We surrender, we surrender, please!","ALL of you, hands up!! Do what {he} says!!","Please don't shoot us, we're just people, we're just people!"}},
