{"ORD_HANDS_UP_OK","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"Hands are up- see 'em? God, this can't be real","Hands up, hands up, I can't stop shaking, I'm so sorry","Okay!! Okay, they're up, they're UP, don't shoot, please don't shoot...","Hands up, hands up, I'm doing it, I'm- oh God, I'm shaking so bad","Please!! I've got kids, I've got nothing, here, look, look!","I'm unarmed, I'm unarmed, no, really, look at my hands, see them?","Don't hurt me, don't hurt me, I'll do whatever you say, whatever you say...","Up, up they go, God, why, why is this happening...","Don't shoot!! Hands- look, they're empty, DON'T SHOOT!!","I'm not armed, I'm just a- I used to sell insurance, please!","There, there, they're up, they're so high, they're touching the sky, please","Mercy, mercy, mercy, I'll do anything, anything you say, anything...","Whatever you want, whatever, just don't hurt my little girl, please","They're up, they're up... sorry, God, I'm so sorry..."}},
{"ORD_HANDS_UP_OK","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned",{"Up, and no tricks, I'm too old for tricks","Hands up, let's talk like adults","Hands up, see? Nobody's reaching for nothing, relax","Fine, fine, there, you've got my attention, now what do you want?","Up they go, slow and easy, you're the one with the gun, you call it","Alright, relax, I'm not going to do anything stupid","Jeez, fine, hands up, happy now?","Hands are up, no weapon, I'm not stupid enough to try something","Up, up they go, take your time, I'm not going anywhere","Fine, there, you've got me, what now?","Calm down, I'm doing it, you don't have to wave that around","Hands up, see? I'm a reasonable person, talk to me"}},
{"ORD_HANDS_UP_OK","reg=law,swat",{"Up they go, but this isn't over","Hands up, slowly, I'm not reaching for my weapon, let's talk about this","Fine, hands are up, but you've just made a big mistake","Easy, easy, my hands are up, but you've made a mistake, a big one","Up, I'm up, we can talk about this like adults","Alright, hands are up, nobody needs to get hurt here","Okay, I'm doing it slow - you don't want this","Hands are up, let's keep this civil","Easy now, I'll do what you say - don't do anything stupid"}},
{"ORD_HANDS_UP_OK","reg=military,elite",{"Compliant","Hands up, I'm complying, don't escalate","Compliant, hands visible, proceed","Compliant, hands up, state your demands","Up, do not escalate","Hands are up - your call","Complying - slow and steady","Hands up, you hold the cards - play them right","Fine, they're up - think about what you're doing"}},
{"ORD_HANDS_UP_OK","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Fine, up, now what?","Alright, hands up, you got the drop on me, congratulations","Easy! What the hell do you want me to do next?","Easy, easy, they're up, relax, let's talk like adults","Fine, hands up, but when this is over, I'm coming for you","Yeah, yeah, hands are up, happy now?","Alright... don't get impatient with me","Easy, boys, {he}'s got the drop, everyone keep calm"}},
