{"ORD_LEAVE_OK","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Alright, we're leaving, no trouble","Okay, we're going, we didn't want trouble","Alright, we'll find somewhere else - come on, let's go","We're leaving - please, just let us go in peace","You don't have to ask twice - come on, move"}},
