{"ORD_LEAVE_OK","reg=military,elite",{"Withdrawing","Copy, withdrawing, stay calm","Understood, we are leaving","Withdrawing, stay calm, no sudden movements","Understood, we're pulling out","Moving out - don't stay here long","Copy that - we're gone - stay sharp","Not my fight - we're leaving"}},
