{"ORD_LEAVE_OK","reg=outlaw,club,crime",{"We were leaving anyway, relax","We're gone, we're gone, nobody wanted trouble","We'll go, this isn't over, but we'll go","Fine, plenty of other places"}},
{"ORD_LEAVE_OK","reg=raider,gang,prison",{"Yeah, we're leaving, not because you said","Whatever, this place stinks anyway","We're going, you better hope we don't meet again","Fine, come on, let's go, we're done here"}},
{"ORD_PRO_LAW","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Thank God, a cop, a real cop, please tell me you've got backup","You're law? Oh, that's a relief, a huge relief, we've been so scared","A badge! Finally, someone who knows what they're doing, please help us","Good, good, we have a few problems you might sort out","Officer, I've never been so glad to see a uniform","Thank God, a cop - please, can you help us? We've been alone for days","You're police? Oh, thank God, there's so many of them out there","A deputy... I almost cried - what do we do?"}},
{"ORD_PRO_LAW","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"Please, please help us, we don't know what to do, we need someone like you"}},
{"ORD_PRO_LAW","reg=law,swat",{"Fellow officer, good to meet you, let's compare notes","Another one of us, thank God, what's your unit?","Another badge - good - who's your department?","Glad to see a colleague, it's been rough out here","Law enforcement, huh, then you know what this is - stay sharp"}},
{"ORD_PRO_LAW","reg=military,elite",{"Law enforcement? Good, we can coordinate, state your jurisdiction","Police - fine - stay out of our way and we'll stay out of yours","A cop, good, you'll keep the civilians calm - where's your unit?"}},
{"ORD_PRO_LAW","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"A cop? Hahaha, here? You've got some nerve, or a death wish","Cop, huh? Make one move and you're dead"}},
{"ORD_PRO_LAW","reg=outlaw,club,crime",{"A cop - great, that's all I need","You're law? Out here the badge doesn't buy much","Easy, officer, we're not doing anything"}},
{"ORD_PRO_LAW","reg=raider,gang,prison",{"A cop? Funny - where's your backup?","A badge doesn't mean much out here - remember that"}},
{"ORD_PRO_MEDIC","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"A medic?! Thank God- c'mon, this way, we got people hurting","Please, please look at her, she's burning up, please","You're a doctor? A nurse? Anything, anything, just help","Finally, someone with training, I can finally rest my hands","A doctor? Please, somebody here's hurt - can you look?","You know medicine? Thank God, we're out of bandages","Please, if you can help, help, we'll give what we can"}},
{"ORD_PRO_MEDIC","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"Oh thank God. Do you know how to help injured people?"}},
{"ORD_PRO_MEDIC","reg=law,swat",{"Medical training? Good, our team could use you","Medical training? Good, we've got wounded back at the post","A medic - stay close to us, you're worth more than a rifle","We could use you, real help's hard to find"}},
{"ORD_PRO_MEDIC","reg=military,elite",{"Medic on site, excellent, report to the surgeon","Medic, you're gold out here - stick close","Good, we've got wounded and nothing to patch them with","Medical training... we should talk"}},
{"ORD_PRO_MEDIC","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"A medic? Now that's useful, you can patch us up, or else"}},
{"ORD_PRO_MEDIC","reg=outlaw,club,crime",{"A doctor? Now that's worth something","Medic, huh, might be worth keeping you around","Careful who you say that to, friend, people kill for medicine"}},
{"ORD_PRO_MEDIC","reg=raider,gang,prison",{"You can patch people? Interesting - don't tell everyone","Medic... we've got some hurt people - think about it","A doc - keep that quiet, or someone'll take you"}},
{"ORD_PRO_MILITARY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"A soldier? Oh, thank goodness, are the others coming?","You served? Maybe you know what's going on, please, tell us","A veteran! We could use your help, we really could","You were in the army? That's good, I feel better already","A soldier - please, tell me you know what to do","A veteran - thank God, someone who knows what they're doing"}},
{"ORD_PRO_MILITARY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"Soldier? Are you here to rescue us? Please say yes"}},
{"ORD_PRO_MILITARY","reg=law,swat",{"Military background? We can use your experience","Service, huh, we could use more people like that","Military - good - where'd you serve?","Veteran, then you know about holding a line"}},
{"ORD_PRO_MILITARY","reg=military,elite",{"A veteran, welcome, which branch, which unit?","Fellow soldier, good to meet you, fall in","Where'd you serve? Who was your CO?","Another vet - good - stay sharp, it's worse than it looks","Respect - tell me what you've seen"}},
{"ORD_PRO_MILITARY","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"A soldier? Heh, you look like you've seen some things, we'll get along"}},
{"ORD_PRO_MILITARY","reg=outlaw,club,crime",{"A soldier, huh - heh, you'd be useful","Veteran - don't suppose you'd like a job?","Still got your training? Interesting"}},
{"ORD_PRO_MILITARY","reg=raider,gang,prison",{"Soldier boy? Where's your army now?","Ex-military - good, maybe you can shoot straight","Ha, your army left you here, same as us"}},
{"ORD_PRO_TRADE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|world=generator",{"You can fix things? Oh, thank God, the generator's been dead for days"}},
{"ORD_PRO_TRADE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|world=door,building",{"A builder? Perfect, we could use some walls, some doors, some hope"}},
{"ORD_PRO_TRADE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"You're handy? Come, come, I've got a list as long as my arm","A handyman, that's worth more than food right now","You can build? Please, we'd pay anything for a hand with the boards"}},
{"ORD_PRO_TRADE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|world=building",{"You can fix stuff? I've got a leaky roof and a broken radio and a bad attitude"}},
{"ORD_PRO_TRADE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"A handyman?! Please, please, can you look at this, it's been broken forever"}},
{"ORD_PRO_TRADE","reg=law,swat",{"Skilled labor, good, we've got repairs to make","Good with tools? We'll trade for it"}},
{"ORD_PRO_TRADE","reg=military,elite",{"Engineering skills, excellent, report to the quartermaster","Skilled labor - useful - where were you based?","Good with tools? We can use you","A mechanic, our truck needs work"}},
{"ORD_PRO_TRADE","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"A handyman? Nice, we've got a lot that needs fixing, and a lot that needs breaking"}},
{"ORD_PRO_TRADE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|world=door",{"You can fix things? We've got a door that won't stay shut, if you've got a minute"}},
{"ORD_PRO_TRADE","reg=law,swat|world=fence",{"A builder, huh - useful, the fence needs mending"}},
{"ORD_PRO_TRADE","reg=law,swat|world=vehicle",{"A mechanic, the patrol car's been dead for days"}},
{"ORD_PRO_TRADE","reg=outlaw,club,crime",{"A fixer, now that's handy","You can build? Name your price","Handy with tools, could be worth something"}},
{"ORD_PRO_TRADE","reg=raider,gang,prison",{"You fix stuff? We've got stuff that needs fixing","A mechanic - heh, maybe you and my truck should meet","Good with your hands - useful"}},
{"ORD_REFUSE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"No!! No, I won't, I won't, leave us alone!","I said no!! Get away from us!","Back off!! Back OFF!! We have guns too!","No!! No, no, no, I won't, you can't make me!","Go away!! Leave us alone!! We have guns too!!","I said NO, back off, back OFF!!"}},
{"ORD_REFUSE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned",{"Not a chance, you're not getting anything from us","You must be out of your mind if you think I'm going to do that","Go to hell, we're not listening to you","Not a chance, you can shove that order up your ass","Make me, go ahead, just try","You really think you can boss us around? Think again"}},
{"ORD_REFUSE","reg=family",{"How dare you, we are a family, you leave us alone!","No, {sir}, not a chance, and shame on you for asking"}},
{"ORD_REFUSE","reg=law,swat",{"You do NOT give me orders, step back now!","Last warning, back off or we shoot!","You're out of line, and you know it","Last chance, back off, or I'll shoot","Not a chance - drop the weapon, now! DROP IT!","You just made a big mistake, down on the ground!","I said stand down! Last warning!","Wrong move, {g:pal|lady} - wrong move!"}},
{"ORD_REFUSE","reg=military,elite",{"No. I'm not letting you do this to us","You have no authority here, back off","Negative, I refuse your order, stand down","No! I won't do it! Keep away!","You picked the wrong people - fight back!","Hostile! Take {him} down!","Not today - defend yourself!"}},
{"ORD_REFUSE","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"You've got a mouth on you, kid, boys, show {him} what we do!","You asked for it! Get {him}!","Nope, nope, nope, boys, fight back!","You've got some nerve, boys, show {him} what we think of orders","Who the hell do you think you are? Kill {him}!"}},
{"ORD_REFUSE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"No! No, get away from me! Stay back!","You're crazy! I'm not doing anything you say!","Leave us alone! Leave us ALONE!","I won't let you hurt us! Back off!"}},
{"ORD_REFUSE","reg=outlaw,club,crime",{"Nobody gives me orders - nobody","You've got guts, let's see how far they get you","Wrong answer, friend - real wrong","Get {him}! Don't let {him} walk away!"}},
{"ORD_REFUSE","reg=raider,gang,prison",{"Come and make me, then!","You think you scare me? Kill {him}!","Big mistake! Get {him}!","Nobody tells me what to do! Nobody!"}},
{"ORD_REFUSE_SOFT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"No, I'm sorry, I can't, please don't be mad, I just can't","I don't want to, I really don't, please understand","No... sorry, no, I can't do that","I don't want to, I really don't, I'm too scared"}},
{"ORD_REFUSE_SOFT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned",{"No, thanks, I'm not doing that","I'd rather not, if it's all the same to you","Nope, I'll pass, find somebody else","Nah, I'll pass, find someone else","No thanks, not today"}},
{"ORD_REFUSE_SOFT","reg=family",{"Oh, I couldn't, honey, I just couldn't","I couldn't, dear, I wouldn't know how"}},
{"ORD_REFUSE_SOFT","reg=law,swat",{"Negative, I won't do that","No, and that's final","No, I don't take orders from civilians","I don't take orders from strangers - move along","That's not happening - try asking nicer","No, and I'd think about how you're talking to me","You're out of line - walk away"}},
{"ORD_REFUSE_SOFT","reg=military,elite",{"Denied, move on","Request refused","Negative, request denied","Negative - stand down","You don't give the orders here - back off","Denied - don't ask again","Not happening - move along"}},
{"ORD_REFUSE_SOFT","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Nah, I'll pass, thanks","Not a chance, {g:pal|lady}","Ha! No, but nice try","Ask somebody else. I'm not doing it"}},
{"ORD_REFUSE_SOFT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"I... I can't - I'm sorry - please don't ask me that","No, I don't know you - I'm not doing that","Please, I don't want any trouble, I'm just trying to get by","I won't, you can't make me - please just go"}},
{"ORD_REFUSE_SOFT","reg=outlaw,club,crime",{"Ha - no - try again, with manners","I don't think so, friend","No deal, find someone else to push around","You're funny - no"}},
{"ORD_REFUSE_SOFT","reg=raider,gang,prison",{"Go to hell","Yeah, no, keep walking","Not a chance - get out of my face","You talking to me? Get lost"}},
{"ORD_RESIST_FIGHT","reg=civilian,family",{"No, no, I'm not doing this","You ain't taking our stuff!","Back off! I mean it!","Get away from us!"}},
{"ORD_RESIST_FIGHT","reg=worker",{"Not today, {g:pal|lady}, not a chance","I've worked too hard for this - no","Get lost - last warning","You want it? Come and get it"}},
{"ORD_RESIST_FIGHT","reg=rescue",{"No, not like this, we'll defend ourselves","Please stop, we will not let you","Back away, I mean it"}},
{"ORD_RESIST_FIGHT","reg=law,swat",{"That's enough - drop it, now!","Last chance - stand down!","You made your choice","{he}'s not backing off - weapons up!","Draw!! Draw your weapons!!","Back up, back up, weapons ready!","Draw, draw, draw!"}},
{"ORD_RESIST_FIGHT","reg=military,elite",{"Trouble, {he} won't stand down","Negative - weapons up","Not happening - fight back","Stand down or we put you down","Weapon up, weapon up, fight back if necessary!","Defensive posture, now!","Defend yourself, defend!"}},
{"ORD_RESIST_FIGHT","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"You picked the wrong crew","Nobody takes from us - nobody","Big mistake, friend","Oh, you're gonna regret this","Now we do this the hard way","Get 'em, boys, get your guns!","Screw it, shoot {him}!","Now! Now! Take {him} down!","Blow {his} head off!","Do {him}, now, do {him}!"}},
{"ORD_RESIST_FIGHT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Don't do it, don't, put it down, put it down!","Oh no, they're going for a gun, everybody get ready!","Screw this, I'm not going down without a fight!","{he} ain't taking it!! Grab it back, GRAB it!","Fight back!! We're not giving up!","Grab something, anything, now!"}},
}
